  "prompt": "/deep-research I'd like you to refer to Homicide Mortality by State from the CDC National Center for Health Statistics and Gun Map: Ownership by State from CBS News. Assess the following states: Wisconsin, Ohio, Michigan, and Missouri. Tell me which state has the lowest ratio of federal licenses in 2021 to homicide mortality deaths in 2022 (i.e., the number of federal licenses in 2021 divided by the number of homicide deaths in 2022).",
  "prompt_prefix": "/deep-research ",
  "instruction": "I'd like you to refer to Homicide Mortality by State from the CDC National Center for Health Statistics and Gun Map: Ownership by State from CBS News. Assess the following states: Wisconsin, Ohio, Michigan, and Missouri. Tell me which state has the lowest ratio of federal licenses in 2021 to homicide mortality deaths in 2022 (i.e., the number of federal licenses in 2021 divided by the number of homicide deaths in 2022).",
  "answer": "Based on the research, here are the findings:\n\n## Data Retrieved\n\n**Federal Firearms Licenses (FFL) 2021 — CBS News \"Gun Map: Ownership by State\"**\n- Wisconsin: 95,430\n- Ohio: 208,661\n- Michigan: 109,835\n- Missouri: 113,351\n- Source: https://www.cbsnews.com/pictures/gun-ownership-rates-by-state\n\n**Homicide Mortality Deaths 2022 — CDC NCHS \"Stats of the States - Homicide Mortality\"**\n- Wisconsin: 266\n- Ohio: 744\n- Michigan: 538\n- Missouri: 555\n- Source: https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/state-stats/deaths/homicide.html\n\n## Ratios Calculated (FFL 2021 ÷ Homicides 2022)\n\n| State | FFL 2021 | Homicides 2022 | Ratio |\n|-------|----------|----------------|-------|\n| Wisconsin | 95,430 | 266 | **358.76** |\n| Ohio | 208,661 | 744 | **280.46** |\n| **Michigan** | **109,835** | **538** | **204.15** |\n| Missouri | 113,351 | 555 | 204.24 |\n\n## Answer\n**Michigan** has the lowest ratio of federal licenses in 2021 to homicide mortality deaths in 2022, at **204.15**.\n\n## Sources\n1. https://www.cbsnews.com/pictures/gun-ownership-rates-by-state\n2. https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/state-stats/deaths/homicide.html",
  "answer_chars": 1093,
  "expected_answer": "Michigan",
